## BrqoshSchemaUpdater Rules

### 1. Type Registry — `MapPostgresType` / `SchemaSqlGuard`

Every new PostgreSQL type in `EnsurePgColumnAsync` or raw DDL **must** register in `SchemaSqlGuard.AllowedPgTypes`.

**If missing — refuse closure:**

> Unsupported PostgreSQL column type: {type}. Add to AllowedPgTypes and run PostgreSqlStartupTests before closure.

### 2. Column Read — `ReadExistingColumns`

Before `ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN`:
- **PostgreSQL:** `information_schema.columns`
- **SQLite:** `pragma_table_info`

Every new column = same PascalCase name in **both** paths with equivalent types.

### 3. Forbidden

| Forbidden | Required |
|-----------|----------|
| PG-only column | same column in SQLite path |
| PG type without registry | registry + SchemaSqlGuardTests |
| Entity change without SchemaUpdater | incremental upgrade |
| close on SQLite PASS only | PG gate mandatory |

---

## Supported PostgreSQL Types (live source: `SchemaSqlGuard.cs`)

| Family | Registered | Notes |
|--------|------------|-------|
| varchar | `character varying(3\|16\|32\|64\|128\|512)` | new length = explicit register |
| integer | `INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0` | SQLite: INTEGER |
| bigint | `BIGINT NULL` | FK · BranchId |
| boolean | `BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false` | SQLite: 0/1 |
| numeric | `NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0` | money |
| uuid | `UUID NULL/NOT NULL` | TenantId |
| timestamptz | `TIMESTAMPTZ NULL` | DeletedAtUtc |
| text/jsonb/date | mandatory register on add | |

---

## EF vs SchemaUpdater — Source of Truth

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **EF (`BrqoshDbContext`)** | truth for empty DB (`EnsureCreated`) |
| **BrqoshSchemaUpdater** | incremental upgrade for existing DBs |
| **SchemaSqlGuard** | gate — rejects unregistered DDL |

**Sync rule:** change touching one touches all three.

---

## 4-Level Schema Closure

| # | Level | Proof |
|---|-------|-------|
| 1 | Code | Entity + DbContext + Updater (SQLite+PG) + Guard |
| 2 | SQLite | `dotnet test` — SchemaUpdater tests |
| 3 | PostgreSQL | `PostgreSqlStartupTests` + `SchemaSqlGuardTests` |
| 4 | Desktop PG | `DatabaseBootstrapService` — zero exceptions |

**No ✅ schema** without all four. Levels 3–4 are not optional.

---

## Agent Workflow (schema change)

```
① Read Entity + DbContext + SchemaUpdater (both paths) + SchemaSqlGuard
② Apply synchronized change
③ Register new PG types + theory tests
④ dotnet test (SQLite)
⑤ schema-gate-pg.ps1 — BRQOSH_REQUIRE_PG=1 for closure
⑥ Report: SQLite ✅ / PG ✅ — or ❌ with next step
```

---

## PR Gate Checklist

- [ ] **schema-gate-sqlite:** `dotnet test` PASS
- [ ] **schema-gate-pg:** `PostgreSqlStartupTests` with `%AppData%/BRQOSH/database.json`
- [ ] **schema-type-registry:** every new PG type in AllowedPgTypes + theory
- [ ] **Desktop smoke PG:** no `Unsupported PostgreSQL column type`
- [ ] **no drift:** identical columns in SQLite and PG paths

```powershell
.\scripts\ops\schema-gate-pg.ps1
$env:BRQOSH_REQUIRE_PG='1'; .\scripts\ops\schema-gate-pg.ps1
dotnet test Brqosh.sln -c Release --filter "FullyQualifiedName~SchemaSqlGuard|FullyQualifiedName~ImmutableAudit"
dotnet test tests/Brqosh.Application.Tests -c Release --filter "FullyQualifiedName~PostgreSqlStartup"
dotnet run --project tools/DbStartupProbe
```

---

## On PG Failure — Agent Response

**Never offer "try SQLite" as final solution.**

1. Read error — usually unregistered type  
2. Add to registry + theory  
3. Re-run PostgreSqlStartupTests + Desktop smoke  
4. Close only after **both** PASS  

SQLite PASS ≠ problem solved.

---

## Agent Forbidden Claims

| Forbidden | Required |
|-----------|----------|
| "column added — tests PASS" | SQLite ✅ / PostgreSQL ✅ or ❌ |
| skip PG because CI lacks it | PG = mandatory manual gate |
| fix Guard without PG test | PostgreSqlStartupTests locally |
| close schema without PG | remains 🔶 |

